<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Hypotekbanken increases 4 pct bond offer.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Hypotekbanken increases 4 pct bond offer.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Hypotekbanken said on Friday that it increased its earlier offer of 800 million crowns in four percent 2002 bonds by 200 million crowns to a total one billion crowns.</p>
<p>The bonds, initially offered on November 1 and later priced at 90.44, had all been sold, the bank added.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
